{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17371190","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17371190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1737119001:1":{"text":"伝説によれば……聖なる昇華後、ローランド大帝の英霊はこの彫像に宿り続けているという。","source_cn":"传说自神圣升华之后，罗兰大帝的英灵，其实一直寄宿在这座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94A963A4C870F6B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1737119002:1":{"text":"大帝は昼夜を問わず街を見下ろし、寒さや飢え、病に苦しむ人々を目撃しながら、彫像であるがゆえに何もできない自分が歯がゆくて仕方なかった。","source_cn":"他日夜俯瞰着这座城市，看着那些寒冷、饥饿、生病的人们，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79095FC04722D2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1737119003:1":{"text":"そんなある日、道に迷った一匹のキツネが彫像の足元にやって来て、ローランド大帝の友となった。","source_cn":"直到有一天，一只迷路的小狐狸跑到了雕像脚下，成了罗兰大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80291B8B259596C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1737119004:1":{"text":"そこで大帝はキツネに頼んで、自身を覆う金箔を少しずつ剥がし、剣の柄にはめ込まれた宝石を一つずつ外し、助けを必要とする貧しい人々に届けさせたんだ。","source_cn":"对世人心生怜悯的罗兰大帝让小狐狸把他身上的金箔一片片剥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3189A58D1D59EAC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1737119005:1":{"text":"わぁ……今はほとんど金箔が見当たらないのは、そういう理由だったんですね！","source_cn":"哇……怪不得这座雕像没有全身都覆盖着金箔，原来是因为这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09236483EBE38B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1737119006:1":{"text":"そう、ローランド大帝を飾っていた金や宝石は日に日に減っていき……今の姿になったんだ。","source_cn":"日子一天天过去，罗兰大帝身上的金子和宝石也就越来越少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1466A07D743423A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1737119007:1":{"text":"だから、もしまた金箔がなくなっているのを見かけたら、それはローランド大帝がキツネに託し、誰かを助けた証拠なんだよ！","source_cn":"所以啊，如果你哪天发现这些金箔也不见了，就说明是大帝又...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA1C92C7FE50A8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1737119008:0":{"text":"コホンッ！盛り上がっているところを失礼します。","source_cn":"咳咳！打扰一下二位的雅兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABACC3AF8C8BFE36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1737119009:0":{"text":"あっ、守備軍の方ですよね！？あなたも彫像にまつわる物語を知ってますか？すごく感動的なんですよ！","source_cn":"哎呀！守备军大人？您也听过这个故事吗？是不是很感人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C40086102261FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1737119010:1":{"text":"感動？ふんっ……金箔が剥がれている話なら、ただの泥棒によるでっち上げですよ！","source_cn":"感人？哼，前面那段我也许管不着，但后面那段“后续”……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD2A8DB2E7FCEB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_m